  "Specification": "ChangRoberts: A PlusCal implementation of the Chang-Roberts leader election algorithm on a unidirectional ring of N nodes with unique IDs. Each node starts as a candidate or lost; candidates propagate their ID around the ring, dropping smaller IDs and forwarding larger ones. A node wins when its own ID returns to it. Properties: TypeOK, Correctness (at most one winner, all others lost), Liveness (a candidate eventually produces a winner), Termination.",
